  digest=b3:2c794bcc2963fc566117c0d3cbf5e5f867d55bdd7b8f363d89ba32ad67dd4489 file=router/internal/finance/cache.go range=106:158 lang=go exported=true byte_range=3024:4897
  sig=func (c *Cache) Do(ctx context.Context, key string, ttl time.Duration, fn func(context.Context) (any, error)) (any, Outcome, error)
  doc=Do returns the cached value for key when it is fresh, and otherwise calls fn\nexactly once across all concurrent callers for that key.\n\nWhen fn fails and a stale entry is still within the grace window, the stale\nvalue answers instead of the error — labeled stale so the surface above can\nsay so. That is the difference between a market page that degrades and one\nthat goes blank the moment a vendor hiccups.
EDGES
